762
00:54:03.578 --> 00:54:07.181
The fuck does
"in-tri-cate" mean?

763
00:54:07.314 --> 00:54:08.716
Intricate.

764
00:54:09.684 --> 00:54:11.786
- Give me the full sentence.
- (scoffs)

765
00:54:16.791 --> 00:54:22.395
"It was a riot of rockets,
and fountains, and people,

766
00:54:22.630 --> 00:54:28.703
