- Good.

775
00:54:58.132 --> 00:55:00.735
See? You're not
so stupid after all, are you?

776
00:55:01.135 --> 00:55:04.071
- Tommy: Not just a pretty face.
- (chuckles)

777
00:55:04.505 --> 00:55:06.574
Here, if I read your book,

778
00:55:06.808 --> 00:55:08.943
