- (Jonathan chuckles softly)

805
00:57:12.533 --> 00:57:14.702
Oh, I mean, it's very good.

806
00:57:15.336 --> 00:57:17.605
Well, we were all wondering
what we might do

807
00:57:17.738 --> 00:57:19.340
