- Do you like steak?

825
00:58:36.617 --> 00:58:37.752
Yeah.

826
00:58:41.622 --> 00:58:43.224
(chain rattling)

827
00:58:58.039 --> 00:59:00.674
So, I was once seeing this...
Fuck me.

828
00:59:00.808 --> 00:59:02.376
