874
01:02:25.980 --> 01:02:27.147
Do you like it?

875
01:02:29.651 --> 01:02:30.751
Yeah.

876
01:02:31.553 --> 01:02:32.453
It's great.

877
01:02:34.522 --> 01:02:36.691
But, I am still on a lead,
