908
01:04:41.649 --> 01:04:45.953
And we can...
we can watch films...

909
01:04:47.221 --> 01:04:48.656
like a proper family.

910
01:04:51.492 --> 01:04:52.393
Yeah?

911
01:04:53.828 --> 01:04:54.962
Look at this.

912
01:04:59.333 --> 01:05:03.971
- Whoo-hoo! (laughs)
- (laughs)

913
01:05:05.807 --> 01:05:06.907
