923
01:05:41.709 --> 01:05:44.411
They've always been there.
We bought it second-hand.

924
01:05:51.118 --> 01:05:53.621
This room used to belong
to someone, didn't it?

925
01:05:55.989 --> 01:05:57.291
Yes.

926
01:05:58.860 --> 01:05:59.993
